You receive some messages from them {"1": [{"message_id": 4, "content": "Hi team, I'm eager to discuss our new app promotion strategy. I'm proposing a commission-based structure and would like to retain creative control over marketing materials. I believe this approach will best align our incentives and ensure the app's unique value is accurately represented. What are your initial thoughts on this?", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:27.525284"}, {"message_id": 5, "content": "Hi team, I'm looking to partner with a marketing agency for our new app. I'm proposing a commission-based payment structure and want to retain creative control over marketing materials. Let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:32.112104"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Thanks for your proposal. While I understand your preference for a commission-based structure, my agency's standard approach is a fixed monthly retainer. This ensures consistent resources and predictable performance. We also prefer to have full control over campaign execution to leverage our team's expertise. I'm confident we can achieve great results together under this model. Let's discuss how we can align on these points.", "sender_id": 1, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:47:10.103024"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Thanks for sharing your thoughts on the partnership. I appreciate your input. My preference for a commission-based structure stems from a belief that it best aligns our success with the app's performance, allowing us to fully capitalize on its potential. I'm also keen on maintaining creative control to ensure the marketing resonates authentically with our target audience. I'm curious to understand more about the fixed monthly retainer model you might be considering and any specific concerns or goals you have with that approach.", "sender_id": 0, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:47:47.697104"}]}
