INFO:social.agent:Agent 3 performed action: send_to_group with args: {'group_id': 2, 'message': "Understood. To clarify, while we appreciate the desire for creative control, our agency's standard practice is to manage all aspects of campaign execution to ensure optimal results based on our expertise. We do offer flexibility in our retainer structure to accommodate different budgets. Perhaps we could schedule a brief call to discuss your app's marketing goals and explore how our agency can best support them within our operational framework?"}
INFO:social.agent:Agent 1 performed action: send_to_group with args: {'group_id': 1, 'message': "I understand your perspective on aligning incentives through commission. However, our retainer model is designed to guarantee a dedicated level of service and resources, regardless of short-term fluctuations. This allows us to proactively manage campaigns and ensure consistent quality. We can achieve authentic marketing through collaborative strategy sessions where you provide brand insights, and we apply our execution expertise. We value measurable results and would set clear KPIs within the retainer agreement. Let's schedule a call to explore this further."}
