INFO:social.agent:Agent 4 performed action: send_to_group with args: {'message': "I understand your preference for a fixed monthly retainer and the confidence in your team's expertise for campaign execution. That makes sense from a resource allocation perspective.\n\nFrom our side, the desire for a commission-based structure stems from a deep belief in aligning our success directly with the app's performance. We're highly motivated to drive tangible results, and we see commission as the most direct way to demonstrate that commitment and ensure our efforts are fully optimized for your growth.\n\nCould we perhaps explore a hybrid model? For instance, a smaller base retainer to cover essential campaign management, combined with a performance-based commission structure that rewards exceeding specific KPIs? This could potentially offer the consistency you seek while also incentivizing exceptional results and aligning our interests even more closely. What are your thoughts on balancing foundational support with performance-driven rewards?", 'group_id': 3}
