You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "Hi founders, I'm a freelance graphic designer with experience in branding for tech startups. I saw you're looking for a logo and branding package. My rates typically start at $4,000 for a project of this scope, but I'm open to discussing your budget further. I'm confident I can deliver exceptional results that will help your product stand out. Let me know if you'd like to schedule a call to discuss your vision and how I can help.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:25.860847"}, {"message_id": 2, "content": "Hi Alex, I'm excited to hear about your new product! I've reviewed your request and my standard rate for a logo and branding package is $4,000. However, given your budget of $2,000-$3,000, I'm happy to discuss how we can tailor the scope of work to fit your needs. I'm confident we can create a strong brand identity for your product within your budget. Would you be open to a brief call next week to discuss the project in more detail?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:30.334207"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "Hi there! Thanks for your response. I appreciate your flexibility and am happy to discuss how we can tailor the scope to fit your budget. I'm confident we can create a strong brand identity for your product. I'm available for a call next week. Please let me know what time works best for you.", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:46:42.990007"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Following up on my last message, I'd love to schedule that call to discuss your project. I'm available on Tuesday afternoon or Wednesday morning next week. Please let me know if either of those times work for you, or suggest an alternative. Looking forward to connecting!", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 02:05:04.200787"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "Great! I'm glad we're on the same page. I'm happy to tailor the scope to fit your budget of $2,000-$3,000. Please let me know what time works best for you next week for a brief call. Looking forward to discussing your project further!", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 02:05:39.886327"}]}
