INFO:social.agent:Agent 0 observing environment: And there are many group chat channels {"1": "agent_dad31660acc2_x_marketing_lead", "2": "agent_a2794e54ebf6_x_marketing_lead", "3": "agent_25771f79dd96_x_marketing_lead"}
