You receive some messages from them {"2": [{"message_id": 1, "content": "I'm looking to partner with a marketing agency for our new app. We're interested in a commission-based payment structure and want to retain creative control over marketing materials. I'm open to discussing how we can make this work.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:32.856693"}, {"message_id": 2, "content": "Hi Marketing Lead, I'm looking to partner with an agency to promote our new app. We're interested in a commission-based payment structure and want to retain significant creative control over marketing materials. What are your thoughts on this approach?", "sender_id": 2, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:40.812573"}, {"message_id": 8, "content": "I understand your preference for a fixed monthly retainer and full campaign control. However, my company is firm on a commission-based payment structure and retaining significant creative input for our new app promotion. I believe we can find a mutually beneficial arrangement. Would you be open to a call next week to discuss this further and explore potential solutions?", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:48:14.598393"}, {"message_id": 13, "content": "I appreciate your willingness to discuss. My priority is a predictable revenue stream for my agency, which is why I favor a retainer model. However, I also value client collaboration. Perhaps we could explore a hybrid model? For instance, a smaller retainer with a performance-based bonus structure that aligns with your commission goals. This would ensure consistent effort while also incentivizing results. Let me know if this is something you'd be open to discussing.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:50:14.724453"}, {"message_id": 15, "content": "A hybrid model with a retainer and performance bonuses is an interesting idea. To ensure I fully understand your proposal, could you outline the specifics of the retainer amount and the performance metrics you envision? This will help me assess if it aligns with our agency's operational costs and ensures consistent resources for your campaign. Once I have those details, I can provide a more informed response.", "sender_id": 3, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:52:14.832093"}]}
