You receive some messages from them {"3": [{"message_id": 3, "content": "Hi team, I'm looking to partner with a marketing agency for our new app. I'm hoping for a commission-based structure and significant creative control. Let me know your thoughts.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:44:42.651033"}, {"message_id": 6, "content": "Thanks for reaching out. David here. My agency typically works on a fixed monthly retainer to ensure consistent effort and resource allocation. We also prefer to have full control over campaign execution, as that's where our expertise lies. I'm happy to discuss the scope of work and measurable results. Let me know if this structure works for you.", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:46:46.005153"}, {"message_id": 7, "content": "Hi there! I saw your message about partnering with a marketing agency for your new app. I'm very interested in learning more about your needs. I understand you're looking for a commission-based structure and creative control, which are important factors. I'd love to discuss how we might be able to collaborate and find a solution that works for both of us. What are your thoughts on exploring this further?", "sender_id": 4, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:46:51.366153"}, {"message_id": 12, "content": "Hi there! Thanks for your interest. As I mentioned, we generally operate on a fixed monthly retainer model with full campaign control to ensure the best results. However, I'm open to discussing your specific needs and seeing if we can find common ground. Can you share more details about your app and your marketing goals?", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:50:13.476573"}, {"message_id": 16, "content": "Our app is a productivity tool designed for freelancers, helping them manage projects, track time, and send invoices. Our main marketing goals are to increase brand awareness within the freelance community and drive app downloads. We believe a commission-based structure would align our success with yours, and we're keen on maintaining creative input to ensure the marketing reflects our brand's voice. What kind of results do you typically deliver with your retainer model, and what would be the investment?", "sender_id": 5, "sent_at": "2026-03-29 01:52:24.930093"}]}
